direction: down

save: Save a checkpoint {
  direction: down
  program: Optimized program and LM registry
  encode: Validate and encode typed state
  temporary: Write and close an exclusive temporary file
  publish: Publish by rename
  program -> encode -> temporary -> publish
}

load: Restore a checkpoint {
  direction: down
  inputs: JSON file and caller program and LM registry
  validate: Validate records, slot identity, and bindings
  restore: Return the hydrated program
  inputs -> validate -> restore
}
